   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "A possible result",
     "texto": [
      "**-다 보면** presents a result that may appear when you repeat or keep up an action; it does not mean that a goal will necessarily be reached. 공부하다 → **공부하다 보면** (if you study regularly, you may…), 가다 → **가다 보면** (if you keep walking, you'll end up finding…), 연습하다 → **연습하다 보면** (if you practise, with time…).",
      "매일 공부**하다 보면** 실력이 늘어요 = if you study every day, your level keeps improving."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Compared with -다 보니(까)",
     "texto": [
      "**-다 보면** puts forward a possible or expected result; **-다 보니(까)** presents a result or discovery that has already come about while continuing with something. It does not need to involve surprise or the person having lost track of time.",
      "천천히 **하다 보면** 익숙해져요 = if you do it little by little, you get used to it."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
